---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

// Product rich results (marketing plan §7.4). `price` mirrors the live displayed price in
// public/js/config.js (priceLabel = "$24USD") — change both together with any catalog change.
const productLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Product",
  name: "TotalRecalls",
  description: "Windows app that downloads your AI chat history from ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, Grok, DeepSeek, Mistral and Qwen Chat into local Markdown + JSON files you own.",
  applicationCategory: "UtilitiesApplication",
  operatingSystem: "Windows 10, Windows 11",
  offers: {
    "@type": "Offer",
    price: "24.00",
    priceCurrency: "USD",
    availability: "https://schema.org/InStock",
    url: "https://totalrecalls.app/buy/",
  },
};
---
<PageLayout title="Pricing — TotalRecalls" description="One-time $24 launch price. No subscription. A Free Tier is available now." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Pricing" }]}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(productLd)} />

  <h1>Pricing</h1>
  <p>TotalRecalls is a small Windows app that downloads and saves your ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, Grok, DeepSeek, Mistral, and Qwen conversations into a private folder on your computer — readable Markdown + JSON you keep forever.</p>
  <p>No subscription. No cloud locker. No account required.</p>

  <section class="price-card">
    <h2>Launch Price</h2>
    <div class="price-block">
      <span class="price-current" data-tr-price>$24<span class="tr-usd">USD</span></span>
      <span class="price-badge">launch price</span>
    </div>
    <p class="price-note">One-time purchase &middot; Windows app &middot; Local files only</p>
    <p class="price-note">Prices may change at any time without advance notice.</p>
    <p>Pay once by card via Paddle. Your license key arrives by email immediately after purchase — enter it in the app (top-right &ldquo;Pro&rdquo; badge &rarr; paste the key &rarr; Activate) to unlock all 8 providers and unlimited downloads.</p>
    <a href="#" data-tr-buy class="buy-button buy-lg">Buy TotalRecalls — <span data-tr-price>$24<span class="tr-usd">USD</span></span></a>
    <p class="guarantee-note">A Free Tier is available now — 3 providers (Perplexity, ChatGPT, Claude) and up to 5 conversations per download — so you can test a real download on your own chats before paying a cent.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What You Get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Download from ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, Grok, DeepSeek, Mistral, and Qwen</li>
      <li>Local Markdown + JSON files</li>
      <li>Private folder structure you own</li>
      <li>No cloud storage</li>
      <li>No telemetry</li>
      <li>No recurring fees</li>
      <li>Free updates (bug fixes) for the life of the product; new features are paid upgrades</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Why $24?</h2>
    <p>Launch price — $24<span class="tr-usd">USD</span> one-time, no subscription. Every conversation, one library, yours forever.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Refunds & the Free Tier</h2>
    <p>Downloader Pro is a one-time purchase. There is <strong>no refund on the Downloader</strong> — the <strong>Free Tier</strong> is our try-before-you-buy mechanism, so you can run a real download on your own chats before paying anything. Your statutory consumer rights are never excluded.</p>
    <p><strong>Smart Search Engine add-on:</strong> 7 days, no questions asked. Email <a href="mailto:support@totalrecalls.app">support@totalrecalls.app</a> within 7 days of purchase and we'll refund it &mdash; no form, no reason needed.</p>
    <p>Your statutory consumer rights always apply &mdash; including the right of cancellation for online purchases that Quebec consumers enjoy &mdash; and are never excluded by our terms.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Why One-Time Pricing?</h2>
    <p>TotalRecalls is a utility, not a subscription service. You pay once, download the app, and keep your archive forever.</p>
    <p>Later, when advanced features arrive (RAG containers, multi-device memory), those will be <strong>paid upgrades</strong> &mdash; not required for basic downloading. Smart Search Engine is available now as an add-on.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Smart Search Engine add-on</h2>
    <p>Smart Search Engine makes your downloaded Library searchable in plain English &mdash; it runs on your PC and nothing is uploaded.</p>
    <div class="price-block">
      <span class="price-current">$29<span class="tr-usd">USD</span></span>
      <span class="price-badge">launch price (regular $58)</span>
    </div>
    <p class="price-note">One-time purchase &middot; Requires TotalRecalls Pro &middot; Windows 10 and 11</p>
    <p>Already own the Downloader? Add Smart Search Engine for <strong>$29<span class="tr-usd">USD</span></strong> at launch.</p>
    <p>Downloader Pro + Smart Search Engine bundle: <strong>$49.89<span class="tr-usd">USD</span></strong> at launch (regular $99.89).</p>
    <a href="/buy/" data-tr-buy data-tr-price-id="sse" class="buy-button buy-lg">Add Smart Search Engine &mdash; <span>$29<span class="tr-usd">USD</span></span></a>
  </section>

  <section class="footer-cta" style="background: var(--tr-graphite); color: var(--tr-paper); text-align: center;">
    <h2 style="color: var(--tr-paper);">Ready to own your AI conversations?</h2>
    <div class="price-block" style="justify-content: center;">
      <span class="price-current" data-tr-price>$24<span class="tr-usd">USD</span></span>
      <span class="price-badge">launch price</span>
    </div>
    <a href="#" data-tr-buy class="buy-button buy-lg">Buy TotalRecalls — <span data-tr-price>$24<span class="tr-usd">USD</span></span></a>
    <p class="guarantee-note" style="color: var(--tr-paper); opacity: 0.85;">A Free Tier is available now — download the app and try it before paying a cent.</p>
    <p><a href="/download/" style="color: var(--tr-paper);">Already purchased? Download ZIP</a></p>
  </section>

</PageLayout>
